=2 Walkthrough
Obtain 4 {@k} {p:Large memory fragments|Large memory fragment} from the following 6 sub-quests:
* {q:Her Memories: Homecoming Queen|Her Memories: Homecoming Queen|Her Memories: Homecoming Queen}, will give you the first {@k} {p:Large memory fragment}.
** {q:Her Memories: Old Bean|Her Memories: Old Bean|Her Memories: Old Bean}
** {q:Her Memories: The Faux Pas|Her Memories: The Faux Pas|Her Memories: The Faux Pas}
** {q:Her Memories: Grave Resolve|Her Memories: Grave Resolve|Her Memories: Grave Resolve}
*** Completing these 3 quests will combine the {@k} {p:Tiny memory fragments|Tiny memory fragment} into the first {@k} {p:Large memory fragment}.
* {q:Her Memories: Of Malign Maladies|Her Memories: Of Malign Maladies|Her Memories: Of Malign Maladies}, will give you the second {@k} {p:Large memory fragment}.
** You may want to begin this quest first, as you will be asked to wait an in-game day to complete it.
* {q:Her Memories: Operation Cupid|Her Memories: Operation Cupid|Her Memories: Operation Cupid}, will give you the third {@k} {p:Large memory fragment}.

Obtain the fourth and last {@k} {p:Large memory fragment} from the {z:Nation} you are allied to in the past:
*  San d'Oria: {q:Her Memories: Carnelian Footfalls|Her Memories: Carnelian Footfalls|Her Memories: Carnelian Footfalls}
*  Bastok: {q:Her Memories: Azure Footfalls|Her Memories: Azure Footfalls|Her Memories: Azure Footfalls}
*  Windurst: {q:Her Memories: Verdure Footfalls|Her Memories: Verdure Footfalls|Her Memories: Verdure Footfalls}

Once you have 4 {@k} {p:Large memory fragments|Large memory fragment}, you will receive a message to return to {p:Cait Sith}, this mission is now completed and you will be on {M:Forget Me Not|Forget Me Not|Forget Me Not}.
